WEBVTT

00:01:30.920 --> 00:01:33.600
--Go, Shoot!

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:42.700
Go!

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:44.650
I will not lose!

00:01:57.640 --> 00:02:01.010
Cerberus is gaining power!

00:02:04.460 --> 00:02:07.730
Burning Cerberus!

00:02:25.730 --> 00:02:27.780
I'm just getting started!

00:02:28.380 --> 00:02:30.220
Go!!

00:02:32.800 --> 00:02:35.050
Cerberus!

00:02:38.940 --> 00:02:40.330
Flash Leopard!

00:02:46.490 --> 00:02:52.250
The final rounds of the world
championships have finally begun.

00:02:52.820 --> 00:02:56.420
Takao saw Zeo for the first
time in a little while,

00:02:56.420 --> 00:03:04.010
But Zeo left us, only saying that he
vowed to steal our Sacred Beasts.

00:03:04.010 --> 00:03:08.940
Zeo, alongside Gordo,
fought the Ozma/Dunga team.

00:03:09.400 --> 00:03:12.540
Zeo's team won handily.

00:03:12.890 --> 00:03:17.840
Seeing Zeo develop so quickly
came as a huge surprise to us.

00:03:53.260 --> 00:03:56.750
Burning Cerberus!

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:27.970
Zeo's got crazy power...

00:04:27.970 --> 00:04:30.960
Where did he even
get that power from?

00:04:31.890 --> 00:04:33.100
Kinomiya.

00:04:33.800 --> 00:04:35.370
What's on your mind?

00:04:35.650 --> 00:04:37.050
Kai.

00:04:37.570 --> 00:04:38.690
Nothing...

00:04:38.690 --> 00:04:42.410
You're fighting the
Kane/Jim team today.

00:04:42.410 --> 00:04:44.840
I know that...

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:47.080
Ignore everything else.

00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:49.660
Just focus on
your match today.

00:04:49.660 --> 00:04:53.760
If you don't, you have no
hope of beating Kane and Jim.

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:57.880
Kai...

00:05:00.060 --> 00:05:02.020
He's right.

00:05:11.440 --> 00:05:14.360
Today's the day, Kane.

00:05:14.360 --> 00:05:15.380
Yeah.

00:05:15.380 --> 00:05:20.440
We're not going to lose to Kinomiya and Max.
Let's give 'em everything we've got!

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:22.550
Yup!

00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:26.040
Three! Two! One!

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:28.450
--Go, Shoot!

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:35.850
That's it! Go!

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:53.910
I see. Your Bey's
not half bad.

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:58.420
Right? I've had my eyes on it
since the press conference.

00:05:58.420 --> 00:06:00.490
--King! Queen!

00:06:00.490 --> 00:06:02.690
I'm taking your Beys.

00:06:02.690 --> 00:06:04.160
Go!

00:06:09.210 --> 00:06:10.300
What?

00:06:22.930 --> 00:06:23.860
Jerks!

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:25.230
Wait, Jim.

00:06:25.680 --> 00:06:27.570
Don't take them on.

00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:29.220
This isn't our stadium.

00:06:29.220 --> 00:06:34.490
The only stadium we fight
in is in the final rounds!

00:06:35.320 --> 00:06:38.570
I don't give a rat's ass
about the final rounds.

00:06:38.570 --> 00:06:41.240
Uriel!!

00:06:49.900 --> 00:06:51.930
Gabriel!!

00:07:18.130 --> 00:07:19.720
It's almost time.

00:07:19.720 --> 00:07:20.930
Yeah!

00:07:20.930 --> 00:07:24.520
I feel sorry for them,
but we'll be winning 2-0!

00:07:26.770 --> 00:07:29.240
This is bad!
Really bad!

00:07:29.240 --> 00:07:31.970
What? Our match is
gonna start soon.

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:33.860
I need some peace and quiet!

00:07:33.860 --> 00:07:36.040
It's Kane and Jim!

00:07:36.370 --> 00:07:38.720
They withdrew from
the first round!

00:07:39.690 --> 00:07:41.160
--Withdrew?

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:43.200
Why?!

00:07:43.200 --> 00:07:47.680
I don't know. You'll have
to ask them for the details.

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:58.130
How are we supposed to
fight with these Beys?

00:08:01.100 --> 00:08:03.250
King and Queen got us good!

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:04.740
Darn it all!

00:08:05.490 --> 00:08:10.090
They showed up while
we were on the beach.

00:08:10.700 --> 00:08:12.740
And attacked us!

00:08:28.180 --> 00:08:29.610
Kinomiya.

00:08:30.100 --> 00:08:31.760
I wanted to...

00:08:33.050 --> 00:08:35.120
Fight you one last time!

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:40.940
Blast...!

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:44.020
Kane...

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:48.890
Where are you going, Takao?

00:08:48.890 --> 00:08:52.130
I will never let them
get away with this!

00:08:52.740 --> 00:08:54.170
Takao...

00:09:04.340 --> 00:09:07.490
I'm getting revenge
for Kane and Jim!

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:10.280
This must be it.

00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:13.570
King! Queen!

00:09:13.980 --> 00:09:15.130
Hey, you!

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:19.160
Come on! Let me go!

00:09:19.160 --> 00:09:25.850
You should know that opponents cannot
contact each other before a match!

00:09:25.850 --> 00:09:32.880
I absolutely have to
see King and Queen!

00:09:35.740 --> 00:09:39.810
You don't see parts
like these every day.

00:09:39.810 --> 00:09:41.680
King. Queen.

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:43.640
Are you ready?

00:09:44.240 --> 00:09:46.930
It's finally your turn.

00:09:48.060 --> 00:09:50.930
You two are up against
Yusuf and Mariam.

00:09:50.930 --> 00:09:53.040
They're tough Bladers.

00:09:53.040 --> 00:09:55.760
Don't let your guard down.

00:09:56.560 --> 00:09:57.710
Hm?

00:10:01.150 --> 00:10:05.260
Were you two the ones
who attacked Kane and Jim?

00:10:07.210 --> 00:10:10.340
Thanks to which,
we got some great parts.

00:10:10.860 --> 00:10:12.420
I advise...

00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:17.070
That you don't
do anything crazy.

00:10:17.070 --> 00:10:21.060
If you get disqualified,
that's the end of everything.

00:10:21.060 --> 00:10:24.010
What are you, my mom?

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:32.050
Don't question the
way we do things.

00:10:32.050 --> 00:10:36.000
We've accepted the duty of
taking the four Sacred Beasts.

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:37.650
But nothing more.

00:10:37.960 --> 00:10:42.290
Other than that, you don't
get to order us around.

00:10:44.210 --> 00:10:47.340
We see parts we want,
and we take them.

00:10:47.340 --> 00:10:50.230
The way we operate
isn't changing.

00:10:52.970 --> 00:10:54.660
And that's that.

00:11:01.570 --> 00:11:03.300
Thanks for waiting!

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:10.730
Our second match is going to start soon!
The King/Queen team VS the Yusuf/Mariam team!

00:11:12.070 --> 00:11:18.370
As for the first match, the Takao Kinomiya/Max Mizuhara team VS the Kane Yamashita/Jim team...

00:11:18.370 --> 00:11:23.010
It was canceled at the Kane/Jim
team's sudden withdrawal!

00:11:23.010 --> 00:11:27.900
Who's going to win
the second match?

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:34.260
The Bladers arrive!

00:11:34.260 --> 00:11:38.000
First is the
Yusuf/Mariam pair!

00:11:57.760 --> 00:12:01.380
Yusuf! Mariam!
You better win!

00:12:03.190 --> 00:12:07.740
And next, the King/Queen pair!

00:12:17.310 --> 00:12:18.630
It's them!

00:12:42.480 --> 00:12:52.410
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:12:53.220 --> 00:12:56.460
Before the battle,
allow me to explain the stadium!

00:12:56.460 --> 00:12:59.450
This battle will be in
the Dome Stadium!

00:12:59.450 --> 00:13:04.300
The Dome Stadium has strong
magnets placed above and below it.

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:09.850
The resulting reactions will create
a powerful magnetic field.

00:13:09.850 --> 00:13:12.750
You won't be able to predict your
Beyblade's movement pattern.

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:15.550
Will the magnetic waves
be your friend or foe?

00:13:15.550 --> 00:13:18.260
That depends on
the Blader's skills!

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:20.970
First battle!
Mariam VS Queen!

00:13:20.970 --> 00:13:24.990
The first girls-only
battle of the tournament!

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:30.040
Good luck, Mariam!

00:13:33.090 --> 00:13:35.040
Are you ready?

00:13:42.690 --> 00:13:44.880
Three! Two! One!

00:13:44.880 --> 00:13:47.450
Go, Shoot!

00:13:58.100 --> 00:14:01.170
Whoa! An intense clash
right out of the gate!

00:14:08.520 --> 00:14:10.690
Look! Those are the
magnetic waves!

00:14:10.690 --> 00:14:13.010
The magnetic waves are
affecting their movement!

00:14:13.010 --> 00:14:15.060
I see it.

00:14:23.700 --> 00:14:26.820
Mariam! What the
hell are you doing?!

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:39.400
Go, Sharcrash!

00:14:41.820 --> 00:14:43.980
She predicted the flow
of the magnetic waves!

00:14:43.980 --> 00:14:45.890
Keep it up, Mariam!

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:53.410
Mariam's using the stadium to her
advantage to make her attack!

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:56.690
Good. Sharcrash!

00:15:06.400 --> 00:15:10.930
Mariam summoned her Sacred Beas
t so she can end the battle fast!

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:22.600
This battle is
far from over.

00:15:24.090 --> 00:15:26.500
Get out here, Gabriel!

00:15:46.410 --> 00:15:51.690
Wow! Queen's Bey is taking
advantage of the magnetic waves!

00:15:53.900 --> 00:15:56.040
Go, Gabriel!

00:16:01.250 --> 00:16:03.100
Hang on, sis!

00:16:23.100 --> 00:16:26.260
King's Bey has interrupted!

00:16:26.260 --> 00:16:27.540
Goodness!

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:32.050
Fighting one after
another is a waste of time!

00:16:36.980 --> 00:16:38.530
I understand.

00:16:38.530 --> 00:16:41.010
I'm on board!

00:16:41.010 --> 00:16:44.350
I'm not just gonna
sit here and watch!

00:16:58.180 --> 00:17:00.690
That's it! Go, Yusuf!

00:17:00.690 --> 00:17:02.490
Old man Daitenji!

00:17:03.680 --> 00:17:06.400
Please! Let 'em fight!

00:17:06.400 --> 00:17:08.400
Fight them! Fight!

00:17:08.400 --> 00:17:11.730
You better not lose!
Yusuf! Mariam!

00:17:19.520 --> 00:17:22.290
We've got word from
Chairman Daitenji!

00:17:22.290 --> 00:17:27.600
This is a special exception from
the BBA--an all out battle royale!

00:18:05.500 --> 00:18:11.160
King's Bey is using Queen's rotation
speed to increase its own!

00:18:30.980 --> 00:18:32.250
But how?

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:38.690
Yusuf is being blocked by the waves the Sacred Beasts emit, so he can't come to Mariam's aid!

00:18:47.740 --> 00:18:50.410
--Go! Finish her off!
--Go! Finish her off!

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:08.570
Why, thank you.

00:19:10.810 --> 00:19:13.280
One down, and one to go.

00:19:13.280 --> 00:19:15.480
Go, Uriel!

00:19:15.480 --> 00:19:17.090
Gabriel!

00:19:42.440 --> 00:19:44.200
Vanishing Moot...

00:19:44.520 --> 00:19:47.010
--Go! Finish him off!

00:20:37.220 --> 00:20:40.550
They're brats, but they
get the job done.

00:20:48.340 --> 00:20:51.970
The King/Queen team win!

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:57.480
They're who Kinomiya
and Max will face...

00:20:59.090 --> 00:21:01.530
This is just awful...

00:21:01.530 --> 00:21:03.740
You can hardly
call that a battle...

00:21:03.740 --> 00:21:06.910
To take pleasure in making
your opponents suffer...

00:21:09.240 --> 00:21:11.900
Those monsters!

00:21:12.180 --> 00:21:15.100
They don't just rely
on cheap tricks.

00:21:16.060 --> 00:21:19.020
They have the skill
to back it up!

00:21:19.240 --> 00:21:20.580
Max!

00:21:21.080 --> 00:21:23.840
We can't lose to them.

00:21:23.840 --> 00:21:25.940
We're gonna win!

00:21:26.940 --> 00:21:28.300
Of course.

00:21:28.300 --> 00:21:31.440
Just you wait!
King! Queen!

00:23:00.280 --> 00:23:04.020
It's finally time for Takao and
Max to fight King and Queen.

00:23:04.020 --> 00:23:10.440
What's this Killer Attack Ring they use?
What's Doctor K's final act of desperation?

00:23:10.440 --> 00:23:14.360
The next match is nigh!
That's a truth you can't deny!

00:23:15.360 --> 00:23:18.880
My joke this time is a little dry!
I'm leaving for now, goodbye!

00:23:18.880 --> 00:23:21.410
Don't miss the next episode!
